62:## Shared evidence rather than direct node handoffs
64:The factory store is the source of task state and evidence. A worker publishes artifacts through a scoped ingestion API; another actor queries the store. Messages and scheduling edges may carry task/job/artifact IDs and short notifications, but producer prose must not become the sole authoritative input to the next actor. File bytes may travel via an authorized artifact resolver; never require copying a growing transcript between nodes.
